# Files that must NOT be published to the public Cloudflare Pages site.
# This repo is private on purpose — only the runtime site assets go live
# (the HTML pages, app JS/CSS, brand assets, and data/*.json the app fetches).
# Internal docs, generators and scripts stay out of the public deploy.
# Requires Wrangler >= 3.90 (the GitHub Action and local wrangler 4.x both honor it).
.github/
.claude/
docs/
scripts/
tools/
node_modules/
*.md
LICENSE
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.toml
